  "description": "The proposed works include the following alterations to the existing roof structure:\n\n• Enlargement of the existing dormers on the north, west, and south-facing roof pitches.\n• Relocation of the existing Velux window on the southern roof pitch and installation of a new conservation-style roof-light on the northern pitch.\n• Flattening of a section of the main pitched roof.\n• Addition of a new flat roof-light to the newly flattened roof section.\n• Installation of multiple solar panels on the enlarged flat roofs of the dormers (north, west, and south elevations) and on the flattened section of the main roof.",
